enshot3.png", "id": "1391543485249581", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824592_1391543488582914_2552783215541715767_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e5l55lpUCmMQ7kNvwGuxSYZ&_nc_oc=Ado6nd-k5AzdRTj7GIhuAVj2Md5gfQJe1fUedfrEMh-N-fuF1X5_k6oTQDLrDk3gpi4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQPw480DHIzSDkADTcqAp343KSUmx2iSWAV87jwRcz0Eg&oe=6AFF3339"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "4067422416841650", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830599_4067422420174983_2260996550380276533_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yv2H6bJ2V2MQ7kNvwH16IBZ&_nc_oc=AdofAqrEXTcf4PkX2zftPQo-nnf5oVjuLGdP1hs9rVDDO8G501EEo4u__FJIdUSvGu0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTwmiT4VAOhUTInvx11OG9c2Zp5PsDJXmKgwRWiQmnBYw&oe=6AFF284C"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "738539269143695", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830589_738539272477028_2490874811966012004_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LK5si2SKrZAQ7kNvwGzSm49&_nc_oc=Ado0i3rCW9eyd9dEbRFhb0-bm0sFzGD-qGqbkaXtGJ0ja8_FnUZacoJrsD2Jtcl3z2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRUmjVUNqHBg0CKGv1DbN5wRtbQQ5IinpSIJea6ZWb-1Q&oe=6AFF36F9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1536060407557291", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823854_1536060410890624_9222553092136700266_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1o8f7BuK5rIQ7kNvwFlCRc-&_nc_oc=AdrTKQ8FvRDS0CWH0krUEJuhc96iHKdI-8R7PBIx24jBREDxYtRsInvS33238rELlqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ13rC5H8Eo2S5mk-HJnQ_WkJlr6ev_ds7ApoWIp7L4sw&oe=6AFF2DC9"}, "display_name": "Crane Signals", "keywords": ["crane", "signals", "hand", "training", "learning"], "long_description": "Crane Signals is a groundbreaking initiative aimed at teaching users the Standard Method hand signals required to communicate with a crane operator and offers a safe, risk-free environment to practice hand signal communications with a responsive crane, load, and realistic physics. Leveraging immersive technologies like VR and hand tracking, we're creating an unparalleled learning journey that captivates and educates like never before. \n\nKey Features:\nStandard Method Tutorial-- Immerse yourself in a realistic simulation that brings learning to life by discovering what each hand signal communicates to the crane operator. \nPractice Your skills-- Now that you know your signals, practice moving a load as you signal to the crane operator.\nHand Tracking-- By using your hands, you learn through embodied cognition, improving retention of knowledge. No more hand controller batteries!\n\nImpact and Benefits: \nCrane Signals promises to revolutionize crane signal training by engaging the trainee in an immersive and risk-free virtual environment. No need to sacrifice the productivity of real-world equipment and operators in order to train. Asynchronous training offers flexibility to those charged with training new personnel, and devices can be sent to training sites at a fraction of the cost associated with moving personnel and equipment. ", "short_description": "Crane Signals is a hand-tracking Virtual Reality (VR) application aimed at teaching users the Standard Method hand signals required to communicate with a crane operator. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://designori.online/crane_signals/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Designori LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://designori.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id":